=2 Walkthrough
>Palborough Mines
!Palborough Mines-map3.jpg||(Map 3)
* __Optional__: Talk to {p:Naji}, {z:Metalworks} (J-8) (HP #1) for a minor comment on addressing injuries after the prior mission.
* Speak with {n:Iron Eater} in the **President's Office** (J-8) in {z:Metalworks} (HP #1) for a cutscene.
* Zone into {z:Palborough Mines} from {z:North Gustaberg} for a cutscene.
** Closest teleport is the {p:Abyssea - Grauberg|Category:Abyssea} warp to the {p:Cavernous Maw}.
** Escaping from {z:Palborough Mines} HP puts you right at the entrance.
* Touch the **Perversion's Refuge** (H-9) on Map 3 for a cutscene.
** This is North of {z:Palborough Mines} Home Point #1.
** If you don't have the HP you can also use {z:Waughroon Shrine} teleport from {n:Domenic}.
* Touch the **Perversion's Refuge** again to begin a confrontation with **Mind-warped Scorpion**.
** Has approximately 50k HP.
** Has an en-Drain effect on melee hits.
* Touch the **Perversion's Refuge** once more for a cutscene and a reward {@i:Iapetus|21886} {p:Iapetus}.
* Return to {n:Iron Eater} for the final cutscene and a reward {@i:Seafood Gratin|6611} {i:Seafood Gratin|Seafood Gratin|6611}.
** __Optional__: Speak with {n:Iron Eater} again for some additional dialogue.

